Project sources are distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
web/core.mjs is generated by the MoonBit compiler from this project's MoonBit
sources and MoonBit core/runtime components, which are also Apache-2.0 licensed.
MoonBit project: https://github.com/moonbitlang/core

The local Node host has no third-party npm runtime dependencies.
The build-only MoonBit script resolves moonbitlang/async separately.

Optional integrations/mcp depends on @modelcontextprotocol/sdk and Zod (MIT).
Their transitive dependency versions and license metadata are recorded in
integrations/mcp/package-lock.json. Dependencies are installed separately;
their source is not vendored into the root library or generated core.
